{"id":"9e711ddb72efdf50","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-godel-sentence.md","title":"Gödel Sentence","display":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-godel-sentence","aliases":["88-df-godel-sentence"],"display":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence","depends_on":["[[88-df-provability-predicate]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[88-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-godel-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-godel-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"268c5641ccf6ec59\" href=\"?note=268c5641ccf6ec59\" title=\"88-df-diagonal-lemma\">88-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-godel-sentence-—-Gödel-Sentence-$G$\">df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\)</span> (formal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,g\">\\(R,g\\)</span> (proof calculus and Gödel coding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\)</span> (proof-rule predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> (standard object-language provability formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\)</span> (standard-provability-formula predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (candidate Gödel sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land T\\vdash_R\\left(\nG\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Pr(\\overline{g(G)})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GodelSent}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(G)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land T\\vdash_R\\left(\nG\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Pr(\\overline{g(G)})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> : 由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"268c5641ccf6ec59\" href=\"?note=268c5641ccf6ec59\" title=\"88-df-diagonal-lemma\">88-df-diagonal-lemma</a>在其充分条件下保证存在的固定点</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(G)\">\\(g(G)\\)</span>是元层Gödel数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(G)}\">\\(\\overline{g(G)}\\)</span>是对象语言数词</li>\n<li>固定点等价式是在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>内部可证的，而不是元语言中的直接恒等式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-godel-sentence-—-Gödel-Sentence-$G$","text":"df-godel-sentence — Gödel Sentence $G$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":